Bindemy Cursos, an online learning platform that I led the development of, with course access and integrated payments.

Cursos was adopted by seven institutions and reached more than 1,000 downloads across platforms. Together, the two apps supported different parts of the learning experience: following a course and getting help directly from a teacher.


